{key: D#m}
{tempo: 110}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [D#m] | ×18

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Sons of Judah born in the land
[C#]Er and Onan and [D#m]Shelah stand
Five sons in all from Pe[F#]rez line
[C#]Hezron and Hamul in de[D#m]sign
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[B]Shattered before the Lord [F#]and his army
The [C#]Cushites fell and none were [D#m]left alive
[B]Help us Lord for we re[F#]ly on you
In your [C#]name we fight the multitude
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
| [D#m] | [D#m] | [D#m] | [D#m] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
